{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X2Uy01CsPC1795683099.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔宏福苑火災一周年，有市民到場獻花悼念死難者，希望遺屬可以走出傷痛。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208539-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%89%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E5%88%B0%E5%A0%B4%E7%8D%BB%E8%8A%B1%E6%82%BC%E5%BF%B5%E6%AD%BB%E9%9B%A3%E8%80%85%E5%86%80%E9%81%BA%E5%B1%AC%E5%8F%AF%E8%B5%B0%E5%87%BA%E5%82%B7%E7%97%9B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>宏福苑大火一周年｜有市民到場獻花悼念死難者　冀遺屬可走出傷痛</strong></a><br/><br/>財政司副司長黃偉綸表示，宏福苑業權收購工作接近尾聲，13戶未接受政府方案的住戶仍有溝通空間，會繼續以情理法兼顧方法跟進。<br/><br/>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208570-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B413%E6%88%B6%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E9%BB%83%E5%81%89%E7%B6%B8%E6%8C%87%E7%BA%8C%E4%BB%A5%E6%83%85%E7%90%86%E6%B3%95%E5%85%BC%E9%A1%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E8%B7%9F%E9%80%B2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>宏福苑大火一周年｜13戶未接受政府方案　黃偉綸指續以情理法兼顧方法跟進</strong></a></p><p></p><p>運輸署下周一上午10時起接受網約車駕駛許可證申請，全程電子化，合資格人士可經智方便申請，填資料及遞交身分證，並網上繳費，申請成功會發出電子版駕駛許可證。</p><p><br/>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208580-%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%8A%E5%8D%8810%E6%99%82%E8%B5%B7%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97%E7%B6%B2%E7%B4%84%E8%BB%8A%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E8%A8%B1%E5%8F%AF%E8%AD%89%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E5%8F%AF%E7%B6%93%E6%99%BA%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>現場｜下周一上午10時起接受網約車駕駛許可證申請　可經智方便申請</strong></a></p><p></p><p>前立法會議員黃錦輝在中大校園內酒後駕駛案，被判120小時社會服務令，罰款6,000元及停牌12個月。<br/><br/>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208518-%E9%BB%83%E9%8C%A6%E8%BC%9D%E6%B6%89%E9%85%92%E9%A7%95%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E8%A3%81%E5%88%A4%E5%AE%98%E8%80%83%E6%85%AE%E5%85%B6%E5%8D%B3%E6%99%82%E8%AA%8D%E7%BD%AA%E5%88%A4120%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%BB%A4%E5%81%9C%E7%89%8C12%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>黃錦輝涉酒駕事件｜裁判官考慮其即時認罪　判120小時社會服務令停牌12個月</strong></a></p><p></p><p>電訊商數碼通下午一度網絡出現問題，公司指已陸續恢復。</p><p><br/>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208579-%E6%95%B8%E7%A2%BC%E9%80%9A%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%88%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A6%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E7%82%BA%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E4%B8%8D%E4%BE%BF%E8%87%B4%E6%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>數碼通下午一度網絡出現問題　為造成不便致歉</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.950368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":431,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:13.861912+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:17:17.117507+00:00","content_hash":"b324ecf6b63a06ce37ae4ec74195981ea3f41db85b2aaca46900f1cbd2ef77ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:24:01.950368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}